OL,3,GNEWSAJustice project helps with village
OL,4,Aflood defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA justice scheme that involves people
OL,7,Fwho have committed low-level offences
OL,8,Fcarrying out community work has helped
OL,9,Fimprove flood defences in a village.
OL,11,FParticipants of the Immediate Justice
OL,12,Fprogramme, including a man in his 50s
OL,13,Fwho was convicted of shoplifting, have
OL,14,Fhelped place tonnes of sandbags at New
OL,15,FCroft garages in Weedon Bec,
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire.
OL,18,FThe project, which is supported by
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire's police and fire
OL,20,Fcommissioner (PFCC) Danielle Stone, has
OL,21,Fworked on more than 80 public areas and
OL,22,Fcommunity spaces in the county.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
